f her hands is pointing like a gun!\n\nIf I could get files with and without the background that would be perfect!\n\nSome more details include: she has a flower on the right side of her hair, it is a red Carnation flower. The red is dark crimson, and her eyes are a lovely colour of purple! Her hair is a gradient going from a dark hazel to crimson. She is a somewhat shy but kind witch.\n\nI may use your work for a phone wallpaper or SNS!\n\nHere is the best references I have of her.\nhttps://imgur.com/kOBksU1\nhttps://imgur.com/nSnapsO\nhttps://imgur.com/YiNIPEC\n\nThank you so much! I look forward to the finished piece (╯▽╰ )", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@MELUNACANTUS/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2877632, "client_id": 2899896, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aebc4fb8/uploads/origins/ba33535a-0bc3-4ee0-8e0e-b3d3cc6ab185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dd37735fc2360eeaf826e2d6a272a34", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aebc4fb8/uploads/origins/ba33535a-0bc3-4ee0-8e0e-b3d3cc6ab185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dd37735fc2360eeaf826e2d6a272a34, https://si.imgix.net/aebc4fb8/uploads/origins/ba33535a-0bc3-4ee0-8e0e-b3d3cc6ab185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc9c62211d06cec3d38f974f039e950e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aebc4fb8/uploads/origins/ba33535a-0bc3-4ee0-8e0e-b3d3cc6ab185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de963065f3d31a7fd9b13b2f7bfca9ff 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aebc4fb8/uploads/origins/ba33535a-0bc3-4ee0-8e0e-b3d3cc6ab185?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14